    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Heroes Stand Tall: M.E.T.A&quot;</strong> is a simple first-person arena shooter built using Unreal Engine and marketplace assets. Created as a personal project, it was developed to learn the full process of making and releasing a game on Steam.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a fast-paced PvP arena, players could choose from a small set of characters and weapons to compete in short, intense death matches. The focus was on core shooting mechanics, quick movement, and getting hands-on experience with FPS game design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is no longer in active development and will be removed from the store. It served as a valuable learning experience and a first step into game development.</p>",
