        "notes": "1. Intense Action: Prepare for fast-paced and intense action sequences, keeping you engaged with frequent combat encounters.\r\n2. Adrenaline-Fueled Gameplay: Dive into the heart of battle with constant engagement in player vs. player gunfights and strategic manoeuvres, ensuring an exhilarating gaming experience.\r\n3. Variety of Weapons: Arm yourself with a diverse arsenal, ranging from firearms to explosives, each offering unique characteristics and effects to suit your playstyle.\r\n4. Immersive Visuals: Experience the thrill of combat without blood and gore or dismemberment; instead, immerse yourself in electric sparks for a visually captivating experience.\r\n5. In-Game Communication: Utilize the in-game chat feature to communicate with other players. Be aware that interactions may introduce mature content, including language, trash-talking, and other forms of online behaviour."
